<title>BULGARIA: FRANKFURT FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 4.</title>
<headline>FRANKFURT FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 4.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The dollar was fixed at 1.8720</p>
<p>marks in Frankfurt on Monday from 1.8477 marks on Friday.</p>
<p>Other main currencies are fixed against the mark at the</p>
<p>following rates (previous in brackets):</p>
<p>    USD   1.8720 (1.8477)	</p>
<p>    GBP   3.0460 (3.0277)   </p>
<p>    CHF 121.9600 (121.8750)  </p>
<p>    JPY   1.5774 (1.5541)    </p>
<p>    ATS  14.2110 (14.2120)    </p>
<p>The exchange rates are used in Bulgaria for accounting,</p>
<p>statistical and customs purposes and are valid for Tuesday,</p>
<p>August 5.</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 911 88</p>
